The port follows Frappe Books v0.36.0 (commit 2f028f42be70a1dbd45bd4c6483d57df2fc64805).
Its schemas, charts of accounts, country data, translations, print templates and
accounting logic are reused or translated from that release. Files copied as they are
live in vendor/books/ and keep their original copyright.

Translations were contributed by the Frappe Books community.

